# --- Houz Ticket (Android door scanner) ------------------------------------
# The APK itself is committed, at public/houz-ticket.apk, because that is how
# it reaches a bouncer's phone: Vercel serves it and they tap a link. Its build
# tree is not — Gradle output and node_modules run to hundreds of megabytes and
# regenerate from apk/www and capacitor.config.json.
apk/node_modules/
apk/android/build/
apk/android/.gradle/
apk/android/app/build/
apk/android/capacitor-cordova-android-plugins/build/
apk/android/local.properties
apk/icon-1024.png
